WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:06.065
Oh, hello there!

2
00:00:06.788 --> 00:00:08.556
Who are you?

3
00:00:09.998 --> 00:00:12.063
I am a leopard.

4
00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:15.428
Leopards are big cats.

5
00:00:17.065 --> 00:00:19.198
Where do you live?

6
00:00:19.523 --> 00:00:22.570
We live in Africa and Asia.

7
00:00:22.753 --> 00:00:26.974
We love jungles and grasslands.

8
00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:30.686
Why are you up in that tree?

9
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.497
Leopards are great climbers.

10
00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:38.539
We watch our prey from trees.

11
00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:42.945
We like to keep food in trees too.

12
00:00:43.577 --> 00:00:47.523
Huh? You keep your food in trees?

13
00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:51.906
Yes! It keeps it safe from our enemies.

14
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:56.060
Lions and hyenas try to steal our food.

15
00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:58.495
What do you eat?

16
00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:02.693
We eat deer, birds, and other animals.

17
00:01:03.148 --> 00:01:06.352
We can swim, so we also eat fish.

18
00:01:07.522 --> 00:01:11.399
Leopards are fast and powerful hunters.

19
00:01:11.954 --> 00:01:15.307
Your dark spots are beautiful!

20
00:01:17.219 --> 00:01:20.513
Our spots blend into the grass and jungle.

21
00:01:20.999 --> 00:01:23.548
That helps us hide while we're hunting.

22
00:01:25.135 --> 00:01:27.421
Do you live alone?

23
00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:31.724
Yes, leopards like to be alone.

24
00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:37.597
Sometimes we make scratch marks on our trees.

25
00:01:37.841 --> 00:01:42.079
That tells other leopards, stay away!

26
00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.611
I'm ready to climb again.

27
00:01:46.254 --> 00:01:47.680
Bye!

28
00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:51.349
Good-bye, Leopard!

